{"suttaId":"an10.49","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-x","vriCode":"s0404m3.mul","paras":[365,365],"vripara":"49"},"segments":{"an10.49:0.3":"Sarīraṭṭhadhammasuttaṃ","an10.49:1.1":"“Dasayime, bhikkhave, dhammā sarīraṭṭhā.","an10.49:1.2":"Katame dasa?","an10.49:1.3":"Sītaṃ, uṇhaṃ, jighacchā, pipāsā, uccāro, passāvo, kāyasaṃvaro, vacīsaṃvaro, ājīvasaṃvaro, ponobhaviko [ponobbhaviko (ka.)] bhavasaṅkhāro – ime kho, bhikkhave, dasa dhammā sarīraṭṭhā”ti.","an10.49:1.5":"Navamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Mp-x","bookName":"Dasakanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0404a.att","from":545,"to":545,"paras":[{"para":545,"vripara":"49-50","refs":["an10.49:1"],"lines":["49-50. Navame <b>ponobbhaviko</b>ti punabbhavanibbattako.","<b>Bhavasaṅkhāro</b>ti bhavasaṅkharaṇakammaṃ.","Imasmiṃ sutte vaṭṭameva kathitaṃ.","Dasame sīlabāhusaccavīriyasatipaññā lokiyalokuttarāmissikā kathitā.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānatthamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["an10.49:1"],["an10.49:1"],["an10.49:1"],["an10.49:1"],["an10.49:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["an10.49:1.3","bhavasaṅkhāro",0,1]]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-x","bookName":"Dasakanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0404t.tik","from":586,"to":586,"paras":[{"para":586,"vripara":"49-50","refs":["an10.49:1"],"lines":["49-50. Navame punabbhavadānaṃ punabbhavo uttarapadalopena, punabbhavo sīlamassāti <b>ponobhaviko,</b> punabbhavadāyakoti attho.","Tenāha <b>“punabbhavanibbattako”</b>ti.","<b>Bhavasaṅkharaṇakamman</b>ti punabbhavanibbattanakakammaṃ.","Dasame natthi vattabbaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["an10.49:1"],["an10.49:1"],["an10.49:1"],["an10.49:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["an10.49:1.3","ponobhaviko",0,0]]}}
